# 🆚 Project 01 vs Project 02

| Feature | Project 01 | Project 02 |
|---|---|---|
| Architecture | `3 → 3 → 1` | `3 → 5 → 4 → 1` |
| Hidden Layers | 1 | 2 |
| Hidden Activation | Sigmoid | ReLU |
| Output Activation | Sigmoid | Sigmoid |
| Backpropagation | Single hidden layer | Two hidden layers |
| Framework | NumPy | NumPy |
| Training | Manual | Manual |
| Problem | Parity | Majority classification |

